  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Core v2.0.4\n\nThe core of the OASIS (Open API System / Omniverse Interoperability System) -- the GOD Protocol and API powering the decentralised Web4-Web10 Omniverse. Contains the OASIS Engine, HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture, Avatar API, Karma API, Holon/Data API, Keys/Wallets API, SEEDS API, and all core interfaces, managers, object models, and enums. Supports 55+ blockchain and decentralised network providers with Auto-FailOver, Auto-LoadBalancing, Auto-Replication, Auto-Sync, Write-Once-Deploy-Everywhere, Offline Support, and Triple-Level Quantum-Resistant Encryption. Explore the full OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source code: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS -- REST API: https://api.web4.oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Core",
